B. Internet connection through a tunnel

Backend:

cd backend

py -3.13 -m venv .venv

.\.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1

python -m pip install --upgrade pip

python -m pip install -r requirements.txt

python run_server.py

Then click on the server: "INFO:     Uvicorn running on http://0.0.0.0:8000 (Press CTRL+C to quit)"



New terminal in Cloudflare:

dir cloudflared.exe

.\cloudflared.exe tunnel --url http://localhost:8000

